OL,3,ANew electric car 'make or break for
OL,4,AJaguar'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJaguar's new electric car represents
OL,7,F"make or break" for the brand, an
OL,8,Findustry expert has said.
OL,10,FParent company JLR has invested
OL,11,Fbillions reinventing Jaguar and has
OL,12,Ffaced mixed reactions over the design
OL,13,Fof the Type 01, which was unveiled this
OL,14,Fweek.
OL,16,FLast month, it emerged Jaguar Land
OL,17,FRover, which has manufacturing sites in
OL,18,FSolihull, Wolverhampton and Halewood on
OL,19,FMerseyside, is to cut 4,000 jobs as it
OL,20,Fstruggles with Chinese competition, US
OL,21,Ftariffs and the transition to electric.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
